# Workflow

1. Upload raw CSV files to Amazon S3

2. Trigger AWS Glue ETL Job

3. Clean and transform the data

4. Generate derived metrics

- BMI
- BMI Category
- Weekly Calories
- Workout Intensity Score

5. Store processed data as Parquet files

6. Register datasets in AWS Glue Catalog

7. Query data using Amazon Athena

8. Load warehouse tables into Amazon Redshift

9. Build dashboards in Amazon QuickSight
